    "detailed_description": "1980's Paperboy meets 2020's Food Delivery Service! Inspired by the classic Paperboy, Food Boy gets players to deliver pizzas in urban environments in an exciting arcade format.<br><br>Make perfect deliveries and knock out furious customers to get the highest scores and unlock new cities and challenges!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><br>A wholesome pizza delivery arcade game that everyone can play! Ride your bike through different streets, try to keep balance, and avoid obstacles to make more deliveries and get the highest scores.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331990/extras/0d78b910f3d08ab34cd326da9296dcc3.poster.avif?t=1727150560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331990/extras/0d78b910f3d08ab34cd326da9296dcc3.webm?t=1727150560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331990/extras/0d78b910f3d08ab34cd326da9296dcc3.mp4?t=1727150560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Foodboy brings a mixture of classic arcade elements with modern, smooth gameplay. Throw pizzas at your customers to make perfect deliveries and knock out enemies to get the highest scores!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331990/extras/09ef31a023c78a5fc6ae93f658a59a79.poster.avif?t=1727150560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331990/extras/09ef31a023c78a5fc6ae93f658a59a79.webm?t=1727150560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331990/extras/09ef31a023c78a5fc6ae93f658a59a79.mp4?t=1727150560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Made in Brazil A fun soundtrack and modern Brazilian references allow everyone to know a little bit more about Brazilian street culture!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331990/extras/4385991934b417eac65ccc1815ad356f.poster.avif?t=1727150560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331990/extras/4385991934b417eac65ccc1815ad356f.webm?t=1727150560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331990/extras/4385991934b417eac65ccc1815ad356f.mp4?t=1727150560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Pizza-throw your way through 4 different worlds with unique challenges and aim for the perfect scores!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331990/extras/078ca3193e53a3e372ac44b8e675833a.poster.avif?t=1727150560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331990/extras/078ca3193e53a3e372ac44b8e675833a.webm?t=1727150560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331990/extras/078ca3193e53a3e372ac44b8e675833a.mp4?t=1727150560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "1980's Paperboy meets 2020's Food Delivery Service! Inspired by the classic Paperboy, Food Boy gets players to deliver pizzas in urban environments in an exciting arcade format.<br><br>Make perfect deliveries and knock out furious customers to get the highest scores and unlock new cities and challenges!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><br>A wholesome pizza delivery arcade game that everyone can play! Ride your bike through different streets, try to keep balance, and avoid obstacles to make more deliveries and get the highest scores.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331990/extras/0d78b910f3d08ab34cd326da9296dcc3.poster.avif?t=1727150560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331990/extras/0d78b910f3d08ab34cd326da9296dcc3.webm?t=1727150560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331990/extras/0d78b910f3d08ab34cd326da9296dcc3.mp4?t=1727150560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Foodboy brings a mixture of classic arcade elements with modern, smooth gameplay. Throw pizzas at your customers to make perfect deliveries and knock out enemies to get the highest scores!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331990/extras/09ef31a023c78a5fc6ae93f658a59a79.poster.avif?t=1727150560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331990/extras/09ef31a023c78a5fc6ae93f658a59a79.webm?t=1727150560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331990/extras/09ef31a023c78a5fc6ae93f658a59a79.mp4?t=1727150560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Made in Brazil A fun soundtrack and modern Brazilian references allow everyone to know a little bit more about Brazilian street culture!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331990/extras/4385991934b417eac65ccc1815ad356f.poster.avif?t=1727150560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331990/extras/4385991934b417eac65ccc1815ad356f.webm?t=1727150560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331990/extras/4385991934b417eac65ccc1815ad356f.mp4?t=1727150560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Pizza-throw your way through 4 different worlds with unique challenges and aim for the perfect scores!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331990/extras/078ca3193e53a3e372ac44b8e675833a.poster.avif?t=1727150560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331990/extras/078ca3193e53a3e372ac44b8e675833a.webm?t=1727150560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331990/extras/078ca3193e53a3e372ac44b8e675833a.mp4?t=1727150560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
